ref #4966 

The `struct block_q8_1` on the CPU uses `float` instead of `ggml_fp16_t`:

```c
#define QK8_1 32
typedef struct {
    float d;               // delta
    float s;               // d * sum(qs[i])
    int8_t  qs[QK8_1];     // quants
} block_q8_1;
static_assert(sizeof(block_q8_1) == 2*sizeof(float) + QK8_1, "wrong q8_1 block size/padding");
```

